WEBVTT

00:00:06.510 --> 00:00:08.900
<i>I hired a maid recently.</i>

00:00:08.900 --> 00:00:11.550
<i>She's hard-working and proper...</i>

00:00:16.030 --> 00:00:20.880
<i>But I'm so curious about her that 
I can't focus on my own stuff.</i>

00:00:22.450 --> 00:00:24.130
<i>Something's suspicious.</i>

00:00:24.540 --> 00:00:29.330
<i>It's suspicious that such a fancy maid would 
come to work at such a tiny old mansion.</i>

00:00:29.870 --> 00:00:32.380
<i>The other day, she was in the study,</i>

00:00:32.380 --> 00:00:37.430
<i>muttering curses or something as she 
read some thick, suspicious book.</i>

00:00:38.070 --> 00:00:39.330
<i>Also...</i>

00:00:39.330 --> 00:00:42.000
May I be of assistance, young master?

00:00:43.630 --> 00:00:46.730
<i>These purple eyes of hers 
that seem to draw me in...</i>

00:00:46.730 --> 00:00:47.910
<i>are suspicious!</i>

00:01:01.330 --> 00:01:06.330
<b>The Maid I Hired Recently
Is Mysterious</b>

00:02:20.640 --> 00:02:25.470
<b>Episode 1:     The Maid I Hired Recently Is Mysterious</b>

00:02:23.000 --> 00:02:24.440
<i>Suspicious...</i>

00:02:24.980 --> 00:02:26.910
Could it be...

00:02:27.220 --> 00:02:29.910
that you're <i>very</i> curious about me?

00:02:29.910 --> 00:02:32.000
H-How could you tell?!

00:02:33.000 --> 00:02:36.250
You can read my mind, can't you?!

00:02:36.250 --> 00:02:38.970
I don't know if it's because I've never 
seen such a pretty maid before...

00:02:39.200 --> 00:02:43.840
But I'm so curious about you that 
I can't even sleep at night.

00:02:44.070 --> 00:02:45.810
You knew that, didn't you?!

00:02:46.920 --> 00:02:47.910
Yes.

00:02:48.170 --> 00:02:49.980
What an amazing maid.

00:02:49.980 --> 00:02:55.790
Y-Young master, starting tonight, I'll prepare 
you an herb tea so that you can sleep better.

00:02:55.790 --> 00:02:57.680
Yes, please do.

00:03:01.590 --> 00:03:03.730
She really is suspicious.

00:03:07.320 --> 00:03:09.680
<i>Just who is she?</i>

00:03:11.330 --> 00:03:12.760
Pardon me.

00:03:14.710 --> 00:03:17.800
Would you like some herb tea, young master?

00:03:17.800 --> 00:03:20.660
Y-Yes, thank you.

00:03:22.920 --> 00:03:25.550
<i>Every move she makes is suspicious.</i>

00:03:25.550 --> 00:03:29.820
<i>And she doesn't say much, 
so I don't know what she's thinking.</i>

00:03:37.050 --> 00:03:41.940
<i>Why have I hired such a suspicious maid?</i>

00:03:46.600 --> 00:03:49.410
I apologize, young master.

00:03:49.410 --> 00:03:52.130
But with the master having passed...

00:03:52.430 --> 00:03:53.620
I know.

00:03:54.030 --> 00:03:56.240
Thank you all for everything.

00:03:58.290 --> 00:03:59.680
Don't worry.

00:03:59.680 --> 00:04:02.100
I'm the master of this mansion now.

00:04:04.090 --> 00:04:05.330
Understood.

00:04:05.670 --> 00:04:08.200
We'll be on our way now.

00:04:08.640 --> 00:04:12.040
Please take of your health, young master.

00:04:12.040 --> 00:04:14.310
Yeah. All of you, too.

00:04:23.620 --> 00:04:29.380
<i>After I lost my parents in a car accident, 
I decided to take over this mansion.</i>

00:04:30.080 --> 00:04:34.740
<i>But the inheritance I got wasn't much, 
so I decided to dismiss all of my servants.</i>

00:04:35.910 --> 00:04:41.480
<i>My relatives all opposed the idea, but I've 
decided to live by myself in this mansion.</i>

00:04:46.260 --> 00:04:47.160
<i>All right.</i>

00:04:47.160 --> 00:04:48.690
<i>Today's the day I get my life together.</i>

00:04:49.170 --> 00:04:53.270
<i>I'm the master of this mansion, after all.</i>

00:04:53.540 --> 00:04:58.280
<i>I have to learn to do everything myself 
and quickly become a grown-up.</i>

00:04:59.030 --> 00:04:59.970
<i>Okay.</i>

00:04:59.970 --> 00:05:02.000
<i>First, I have to make breakfast.</i>

00:05:18.810 --> 00:05:20.550
<i>Next, laundry.</i>

00:05:27.320 --> 00:05:29.520
That was a piece of cake.

00:05:33.790 --> 00:05:35.480
Whoa!

00:05:40.100 --> 00:05:42.110
Next, vacuuming.

00:05:43.730 --> 00:05:46.660
Whoa, it's so powerful!

00:05:46.660 --> 00:05:48.150
It sucks in everything!

00:05:53.960 --> 00:05:55.220
No, wait!

00:06:05.880 --> 00:06:07.260
<i>So tired.</i>

00:06:07.650 --> 00:06:10.920
<i>I never knew life would be 
so hard without any servants.</i>

00:06:16.970 --> 00:06:20.600
Even I can pour hot water 
and wait for a bit.

00:06:49.540 --> 00:06:51.400
<i>Who is she?</i>

00:06:51.920 --> 00:06:54.870
<i>I don't think we had a maid like her.</i>

00:06:55.800 --> 00:06:57.150
<i>Something's suspicious.</i>

00:06:58.600 --> 00:06:59.940
Wh-Who are you?!

00:07:00.770 --> 00:07:02.870
I apologize for coming so late at night.

00:07:04.080 --> 00:07:08.040
From what I can see, it would seem 
that you don't have any servants.

00:07:08.470 --> 00:07:10.400
Are you here by yourself?

00:07:10.690 --> 00:07:11.970
I am.

00:07:12.390 --> 00:07:13.980
What's your business at my mansion?

00:07:16.060 --> 00:07:18.880
Forgive me for approaching 
you unsolicited...

00:07:19.260 --> 00:07:23.720
But would you be so kind as 
to hire me at this mansion?

00:07:25.250 --> 00:07:27.390
<i>What is she talking about?</i>

00:07:27.760 --> 00:07:29.240
<i>So late at night...</i>

00:07:30.560 --> 00:07:32.680
<i>This is even more suspicious.</i>

00:07:33.080 --> 00:07:34.130
No...

00:07:34.130 --> 00:07:35.800
I'm not wealthy.

00:07:35.800 --> 00:07:38.880
I just dismissed my servants earlier.

00:07:38.880 --> 00:07:41.510
No, I don't need to be paid.

00:07:41.510 --> 00:07:45.880
I only ask to be allowed to 
serve as a live-in maid.

00:07:48.120 --> 00:07:51.830
Do you not find it inconvenient 
living by yourself?

00:07:52.760 --> 00:07:54.410
N-Not especially.

00:07:55.280 --> 00:07:57.520
If you would allow me,

00:07:57.520 --> 00:08:04.290
I will do the cleaning, laundry, and cooking 
to your satisfaction, young master.

00:08:04.290 --> 00:08:06.390
I-I don't need any of tha—

00:08:14.840 --> 00:08:16.530
<i>Her eyes are pretty.</i>

00:08:17.290 --> 00:08:19.330
<i>What is this? I...</i>

00:08:20.260 --> 00:08:23.970
<i>I feel as though I've seen 
these eyes somewhere before.</i>

00:08:26.480 --> 00:08:28.030
What do you say?

00:08:32.160 --> 00:08:34.150
F-Fine.

00:08:34.480 --> 00:08:37.580
I'm the master of this house, though.

00:08:37.580 --> 00:08:40.560
If it turns out you're useless, 
I'm throwing you out.

00:08:40.560 --> 00:08:41.570
Got it?

00:08:41.900 --> 00:08:43.020
Yes.

00:08:43.020 --> 00:08:45.690
Thank you, young master.

00:08:49.960 --> 00:08:52.880
<i>I probably should have said no.</i>

00:08:53.420 --> 00:08:57.090
<i>But unlike any of the maids I had before,</i>

00:08:57.680 --> 00:09:00.600
<i>every meal she makes is delicious.</i>

00:09:00.910 --> 00:09:04.920
<i>When she cleans, the place 
looks more sparkly than ever.</i>

00:09:04.920 --> 00:09:05.730
<i>And...</i>

00:09:07.180 --> 00:09:11.520
<i>When she washes my clothes,
they smell so nice.</i>

00:09:12.870 --> 00:09:16.160
<i>I feel like I'm under a spell.</i>

00:09:17.850 --> 00:09:18.990
<i>A spell?</i>

00:09:18.990 --> 00:09:20.190
<i>That's it!</i>

00:09:20.660 --> 00:09:23.690
You're a sorcerer, aren't you?!

00:09:24.020 --> 00:09:25.460
A sorcerer?

00:09:25.660 --> 00:09:29.390
The impossibly delicious food, 
the spotless rooms,

00:09:29.390 --> 00:09:31.680
the comfortable clothes, and...

00:09:31.680 --> 00:09:33.670
those suspicious eyes!

00:09:33.670 --> 00:09:36.040
You aren't a normal human, are you?

00:09:37.310 --> 00:09:39.400
You've figured me out, huh?

00:09:41.440 --> 00:09:42.800
That's right.

00:09:42.800 --> 00:09:46.170
I'm a sorcerer.

00:09:46.640 --> 00:09:52.470
The truth is, I used these eyes 
to cast a bewitching spell on you.

00:09:53.470 --> 00:09:57.240
You fell for it completely, young master.

00:09:58.140 --> 00:09:59.320
Nah, just ki—

00:09:59.320 --> 00:10:01.070
So I was right!

00:10:02.070 --> 00:10:04.140
I knew it all along!

00:10:04.140 --> 00:10:09.010
I caught you reading a magic book 
in the study and chanting spells!

00:10:09.010 --> 00:10:12.910
And everything you clean has a glow.

00:10:12.910 --> 00:10:15.250
Everything you wash has a pleasant scent.

00:10:15.250 --> 00:10:22.000
And those eyes... They sparkle 
like gems and suck you right in...

00:10:22.310 --> 00:10:25.620
Those eyes, which lock my gaze 
and send my heart racing...

00:10:25.620 --> 00:10:28.720
were meant to bewitch me!

00:10:28.720 --> 00:10:31.230
What terrifying magic!

00:10:35.390 --> 00:10:40.000
Y-Young master, I must go shopping now.

00:10:40.510 --> 00:10:41.730
Wait!

00:10:46.830 --> 00:10:50.060
<i>I only meant that as a joke.</i>

00:10:50.590 --> 00:10:54.450
<i>And that book in the study 
was about housekeeping.</i>

00:10:55.000 --> 00:10:59.470
<b>The Maid I Hired Recently
Is Mysterious</b>

00:10:56.620 --> 00:10:59.130
<i>The Maid I Hired Recently Is Mysterious</i>.

00:11:03.060 --> 00:11:05.410
<i>I was so shocked earlier,</i>

00:11:05.410 --> 00:11:08.310
<i>I lost my chance to confront her 
about what she was scheming.</i>

00:11:09.000 --> 00:11:13.560
<i>But if she really is a sorcerer, 
what is her goal here?</i>

00:11:14.060 --> 00:11:17.890
<i>Why did she come to such a poor mansion?</i>

00:11:20.010 --> 00:11:23.320
Young master, have you 
finished your homework?

00:11:24.910 --> 00:11:26.910
<i>No point in thinking about it forever.</i>

00:11:26.910 --> 00:11:29.210
<i>I'm the master of this mansion.</i>

00:11:29.210 --> 00:11:31.590
<i>I'll ask her what it is she's after.</i>

00:11:32.300 --> 00:11:35.720
Oh, it's noon. I'll prepare lunch right awa—

00:11:35.720 --> 00:11:36.960
What are you plotting?

00:11:37.200 --> 00:11:38.000
What?

00:11:38.550 --> 00:11:40.840
Oh, well...

00:11:40.840 --> 00:11:47.360
We had cold eggplant udon yesterday, 
so how about oyakodon today?

00:11:48.210 --> 00:11:49.240
Really?

00:11:49.240 --> 00:11:50.620
Yay!

00:11:50.620 --> 00:11:51.970
Wait, no!

00:11:51.970 --> 00:11:54.250
I'm not talking about lunch.

00:11:54.250 --> 00:11:57.500
I'm asking why you came to this mansion!

00:11:57.810 --> 00:11:59.230
Uh-huh...

00:11:59.230 --> 00:12:00.300
<i>All right...</i>

00:12:00.300 --> 00:12:02.610
<i>I'm going to expose you for who you are!</i>

00:12:04.990 --> 00:12:06.560
Why are you grinning?

00:12:06.560 --> 00:12:09.860
You <i>are</i> scheming something, aren't you?

00:12:10.330 --> 00:12:11.870
No, of course not.

00:12:12.630 --> 00:12:16.880
It's just that you're so 
adorable when you watch me.

00:12:17.470 --> 00:12:20.380
I simply couldn't contain my smile.

00:12:20.380 --> 00:12:21.140
Lies!

00:12:22.320 --> 00:12:26.750
I don't smile like that even 
if I think you're cute!

00:12:26.750 --> 00:12:30.680
No matter how cute you are, 
you aren't fooling me!

00:12:30.680 --> 00:12:36.140
When I look at you, my chest tenses 
up and I can't focus on anything.

00:12:36.140 --> 00:12:39.030
And it's not just your smile.
Your expressions make me so tense,

00:12:39.030 --> 00:12:41.790
I can't stand to look at your face.

00:12:41.790 --> 00:12:43.490
You aren't fooling me!

00:12:43.490 --> 00:12:45.670
Why have you come to be my maid?

00:12:45.670 --> 00:12:47.160
Tell me what you're after!

00:12:51.230 --> 00:12:53.580
Wh-What I'm after?

00:12:54.600 --> 00:12:56.080
Well...

00:12:58.110 --> 00:13:01.520
I can't tell you yet.

00:13:04.980 --> 00:13:08.300
<i>I knew it! She </i>is<i> scheming 
something, isn't she?!</i>

00:13:18.500 --> 00:13:21.010
What's the matter, young master?

00:13:24.600 --> 00:13:27.730
There's plenty more, if you'd like.

00:13:35.850 --> 00:13:37.860
Oh, it was just a dream.

00:13:39.050 --> 00:13:41.910
<i>She's been on my mind so 
much since she arrived</i>

00:13:41.910 --> 00:13:45.470
<i>that she's showing up in 
my dreams every night.</i>

00:13:46.300 --> 00:13:48.440
I'm thirsty.

00:13:51.890 --> 00:13:53.710
So hot...

00:13:53.710 --> 00:13:56.670
Why is it so hot every night?

00:13:59.450 --> 00:14:01.610
<i>This late at night?</i>

00:14:01.610 --> 00:14:03.280
<i>Is it a burglar?!</i>

00:14:04.260 --> 00:14:05.560
<i>What do I do?</i>

00:14:05.560 --> 00:14:07.360
<i>Should I wake her?</i>

00:14:07.360 --> 00:14:10.860
<i>No, they might run away in the meantime.</i>

00:14:11.990 --> 00:14:14.530
<i>Sheesh, what am I afraid of?</i>

00:14:14.530 --> 00:14:16.820
<i>I'm the master of this mansion.</i>

00:14:16.820 --> 00:14:18.840
<i>I have to be the one to protect it.</i>

00:14:23.930 --> 00:14:25.790
<i>Oh, it's just her.</i>

00:14:26.350 --> 00:14:29.360
<i>Wait, what is she doing at this time of night?</i>

00:14:30.010 --> 00:14:32.310
<i>S-Suspicious...</i>

00:14:42.610 --> 00:14:44.990
Good morning, young master.

00:14:46.220 --> 00:14:47.670
Morning.

00:14:48.540 --> 00:14:50.230
Thanks for cooking breakfast.

00:14:53.050 --> 00:14:54.080
That's good.

00:14:58.480 --> 00:14:59.830
This is good, too.

00:15:00.140 --> 00:15:04.090
There's plenty more. Please let 
me know if you'd like seconds.

00:15:09.510 --> 00:15:11.090
Hey, you!

00:15:11.090 --> 00:15:14.300
You put something suspicious 
in my food, didn't you?

00:15:15.310 --> 00:15:20.630
I saw you doing something in the 
kitchen in the middle of the night.

00:15:20.630 --> 00:15:22.180
What exactly were you doing?

00:15:23.250 --> 00:15:26.330
Ah, you caught me.

00:15:26.780 --> 00:15:29.240
I did put something in that dish...

00:15:30.150 --> 00:15:33.420
A potion to make you fall in love with me.

00:15:33.420 --> 00:15:36.990
It's what they call a "love potion."

00:15:36.990 --> 00:15:38.460
L-Love...

00:15:38.780 --> 00:15:41.920
I'm impressed that you caught on.

00:15:41.920 --> 00:15:44.430
Wh-What?!

00:15:44.640 --> 00:15:47.430
<i>How could she put a love 
potion in her master's food?</i>

00:15:47.430 --> 00:15:49.910
<i>She's definitely not just a maid.</i>

00:15:49.910 --> 00:15:51.190
I get it!

00:15:51.190 --> 00:15:55.260
So that was a love potion you 
were up making last night!

00:15:55.260 --> 00:16:01.060
Damn, no wonder your food 
tasted so good to me.

00:16:01.060 --> 00:16:03.350
And it explains why I can't stop staring at you,

00:16:03.350 --> 00:16:06.030
and why my heart races when our eyes meet,

00:16:06.030 --> 00:16:08.740
and why I can't help but 
think you're really cute...

00:16:08.740 --> 00:16:12.070
It's all due to that love potion!

00:16:15.280 --> 00:16:17.110
Y-Yes.

00:16:18.140 --> 00:16:25.190
<i>I'm too embarrassed to tell him I 
was actually just studying cooking</i>

00:16:25.190 --> 00:16:27.060
<i>so that I could make good meals for him.</i>

00:16:28.220 --> 00:16:30.350
No more love potions. Got it?

00:16:30.350 --> 00:16:32.540
U-Understood.

00:16:33.220 --> 00:16:37.720
<b>The Maid I Hired Recently
Is Mysterious</b>

00:16:34.320 --> 00:16:37.290
<i>The Maid I Hired Recently Is Mysterious</i>.

00:16:40.360 --> 00:16:44.060
I feel like she's always 
dodging the subject.

00:16:45.800 --> 00:16:48.480
<i>That stuff about being a sorcerer, 
about love potions...</i>

00:16:48.480 --> 00:16:51.230
<i>What exactly is she thinking?</i>

00:16:58.930 --> 00:17:03.130
<i>Come to think of it, 
I don't know much about her.</i>

00:17:03.490 --> 00:17:08.030
<i>She knows what I like and hate to eat,</i>

00:17:08.030 --> 00:17:12.620
<i>but I don't know anything about 
what she likes or hates.</i>

00:17:13.220 --> 00:17:14.870
<i>I don't even know her name.</i>

00:17:18.330 --> 00:17:20.030
Hey, you.

00:17:20.030 --> 00:17:21.170
Yes?

00:17:21.170 --> 00:17:24.430
May I help you, Master Yuuri?

00:17:25.680 --> 00:17:28.270
<i>Why is she calling me by my name now?!</i>

00:17:28.270 --> 00:17:31.400
<i>She hasn't done that before!</i>

00:17:31.400 --> 00:17:33.390
<i>S-Suspicious!</i>

00:17:33.950 --> 00:17:37.290
Why are you calling me by name now?! 
What are you scheming?

00:17:37.790 --> 00:17:40.160
Scheming, you say?

00:17:40.890 --> 00:17:46.160
I believe it's normal for a maid 
to address her master by name.

00:17:46.470 --> 00:17:50.010
I never expected you to 
react that way, though.

00:17:51.020 --> 00:17:52.330
Could it be...

00:17:53.510 --> 00:17:55.470
that you're embarrassed?

00:17:55.470 --> 00:17:57.380
You make it sound like we're married!

00:17:58.480 --> 00:18:01.330
My parents called each other by name.

00:18:01.330 --> 00:18:02.800
They were madly in love!

00:18:02.800 --> 00:18:04.650
M-Madly in love?!

00:18:04.960 --> 00:18:07.540
I-I didn't mean it that intensely.

00:18:08.180 --> 00:18:09.560
Not that intensely?

00:18:09.560 --> 00:18:11.080
U-Um...

00:18:11.080 --> 00:18:12.610
I must go shopping.

00:18:12.610 --> 00:18:14.160
Pardon me!

00:18:14.160 --> 00:18:15.310
Hey!

00:18:16.710 --> 00:18:18.550
She ran away again.

00:18:18.550 --> 00:18:20.310
Suspicious.

00:18:20.640 --> 00:18:22.140
<i>She was so rattled.</i>

00:18:22.140 --> 00:18:24.060
<i>She's definitely hiding something.</i>

00:18:25.440 --> 00:18:30.120
<i>Is she telling me that she has 
all my private information?</i>

00:18:30.360 --> 00:18:33.990
<i>Crap, what is she doing with 
my private information?</i>

00:18:33.990 --> 00:18:36.220
<i>Is she going to doxx me?</i>

00:18:36.860 --> 00:18:40.130
<i>Or is she going to sell it to 
some underground organization?</i>

00:18:40.430 --> 00:18:44.340
<i>I'm her master, and I don't 
know anything about her.</i>

00:18:45.910 --> 00:18:47.150
<i>I'll look her up.</i>

00:18:47.150 --> 00:18:51.400
<i>And I'll prove that I know more 
about her than she does about me.</i>

00:18:52.300 --> 00:18:55.400
Hmm, it should be around here somewhere...

00:18:55.620 --> 00:18:56.470
Found it.

00:19:00.600 --> 00:19:01.700
Lilith...

00:19:02.250 --> 00:19:05.070
So her name's Lilith!

00:19:06.940 --> 00:19:12.810
Her name is already suspicious, 
but at last, I know something about her.

00:19:14.060 --> 00:19:15.240
<i>Okay, go on.</i>

00:19:15.570 --> 00:19:17.720
<i>Try saying my name.</i>

00:19:17.990 --> 00:19:22.840
<i>I'll call you by name and 
show that I know about you.</i>

00:19:23.390 --> 00:19:29.960
Dinner tonight will be cold tomato pasta 
and summer vegetable soup, young master.

00:19:32.170 --> 00:19:34.430
Aren't you going to use my name?

00:19:35.850 --> 00:19:39.670
Would you like me to say your name more often?

00:19:40.030 --> 00:19:41.790
Y-Yeah...

00:19:42.150 --> 00:19:44.030
But if I did...

00:19:44.990 --> 00:19:48.380
we would end up becoming 
close, young master.

00:19:49.080 --> 00:19:51.990
Merely saying one's name 
wouldn't make you closer.

00:19:53.750 --> 00:19:56.440
My parents were madly in love,

00:19:56.440 --> 00:20:00.060
but that was because they 
understood each other well.

00:20:00.060 --> 00:20:05.810
I, however, don't know 
the first thing about you.

00:20:06.600 --> 00:20:09.100
Yes, you're right.

00:20:09.100 --> 00:20:10.430
Obviously.

00:20:11.890 --> 00:20:17.680
So you can tell your master 
more about yourself, Lilith.

00:20:22.850 --> 00:20:23.820
Okay.

00:20:24.970 --> 00:20:27.570
It's not that I trust you yet.

00:20:27.970 --> 00:20:31.930
I'm going to grow up as soon as I 
can and expose you for who you are.

00:20:33.220 --> 00:20:36.260
Understood, Master Yuuri.

00:20:49.620 --> 00:20:53.760
Speaking of which, why did you suddenly 
decide to call me by my name?

00:20:54.210 --> 00:20:58.740
There wasn't any particular reason for it.

00:20:58.740 --> 00:20:59.910
Oh.

00:21:45.970 --> 00:21:47.640
Master Yuuri...

00:23:18.960 --> 00:23:23.950
<b>Next Time
Episode 2: The Young Master, the Cat, and the Morning Glory</b>
